WEBVTT

00:00:00.799 --> 00:00:05.185
Before payroll close, a manager needs a
clear view of the week.

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:09.645
In Sundae Crew, start in Attendance with the
matrix selected.

00:00:09.982 --> 00:00:12.673
Check the outlet and the date range first.

00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:15.962
Each row keeps one person's week together.

00:00:16.347 --> 00:00:19.786
Use the status key to understand recorded
activity,

00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:22.539
missing punches and exceptions.

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:25.280
Now switch on Exceptions.

00:00:25.568 --> 00:00:29.442
The matrix narrows the review to people with
flagged days,

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:32.245
while keeping the rest of their week
visible.

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:36.195
Inspect the flagged day before choosing a
correction.

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:39.222
The manager follows the correction process,

00:00:39.435 --> 00:00:42.163
then rechecks the week before payroll.

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:43.533
Sundae.

00:00:44.113 --> 00:00:45.933
See every layer, act in time.
